# Public repository rules

npp-x is a **public** open-source project. Follow these when editing or reviewing.

## Never commit

- Secrets, tokens, `.env` with credentials, signing keys, Apple/Windows certs
- Private REA dumps, Notepad++ portable binaries, or large reconstructed artifacts (keep outside the repo; document paths in `docs/REA-RECONSTRUCTION.md` only)
- Personal notes that name private machines, emails beyond what’s already public, or unpublished vuln details

## Attribution & trademarks

- npp-x is **inspired by / reconstructed from** Notepad++ — it is **not** the official Notepad++ project
- Do not claim Don Ho / Notepad++ endorsement
- Prefer “N++-inspired” / “reconstructed from N++ 8.8.1” wording in user-facing copy

## Ownership

- Default CODEOWNER is `@arun-prasad-t` (see `.github/CODEOWNERS`)
- Prefer PRs over direct `main` pushes for shared work; keep `main` releasable

## License

- Project license is **MIT** (`LICENSE`)
- Don’t add GPL-only dependencies without an explicit maintainer decision

## Security

- Public issues for bugs; private advisories for vulns (`SECURITY.md`)
- Treat third-party theme/plugin packages as untrusted code
